  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23d2788a51d119cc",
      "translationZh": "如果你能看到这段文字，你可能应该直接去享受你的周末了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d791f13926c7c3f",
      "translationZh": "2026年10月1日至2026年10月2日的AI新闻。我们检查了12个Subreddit、544个Twitter账号，没有查看其他的Discord。AINews网站允许你搜索所有过往期数。提醒一下，AINews现在是Latent Space的一个板块。你可以选择加入或退出邮件推送频率！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca63aa20797f8035",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6.1 Sol和Sonnet 5.5重塑性价比边界",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b51359a7705db18f",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6.1 Sol发布：OpenAI将Sol的价格定为每百万输入/输出token为2/10，而Astra的价格为10/50（价格摘要）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cd999b87ada7b88",
      "translationZh": "声称的结果：据报道，它在DeepSWE v1.1上比GPT-6 Sol高出6.4分，在AutomationBench上比Opus 5.5高出2.2分（摘要）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08b51fc9e205e54a",
      "translationZh": "定位：OpenAI员工将其描述为“好、便宜且快”（@reach_vb）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7231da15d0be5ca8",
      "translationZh": "Codex使用情况：全球Codex使用情况重置定于太平洋时间10月2日上午10点（@reach_vb）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73a76fc0a92e5a8b",
      "translationZh": "工具使用：据报道Sol“非常喜欢codemode”，这与GPT模型在其上进行训练是一致的（@badlogicgames，codemode说明）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70ac457713871a1f",
      "translationZh": "Agent Arena 排名：Sol [Max] 以第 5 名（+11.23%）进入榜单，每项任务的中位成本为 0.56（@arena）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f9d7847125c2580",
      "translationZh": "Sol 成本比较：这比 GPT-6 Sol 便宜 39%，同时得分高出 1.52 分。它比 Astra 便宜 81%，且分差保持在 1.04 分以内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5708edb16a760eb3",
      "translationZh": "Sonnet 5.5：Sonnet 5.5 [Max] 以第 3 名（+12.5%）首次亮相，并在 Chat 类别中排名第 1。其每项任务成本为 2.74，而排名第 2 的 Opus 5.5 为 1.58，这使其未能进入帕累托前沿（debut，frontier）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18bfbe00bb73eb61",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 的地位：Anthropic 的模型目前占据了 Agent Arena 的前三个席位。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3526f50eac977d4",
      "translationZh": "Code and Text Arena：Sol 在 Sonnet 5.5 将其挤至第 4 名之前，曾短暂进入 WebDev 领域的第 3 名（weekly recap）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70d08b918e5ba194",
      "translationZh": "Sonnet 在 WebDev 上的表现：Sonnet 目前在 WebDev 领域落后 GPT-6 Astra [Max] 2 分，但成本降低了 80%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "670d7f9acaa50165",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：Argon [High] 在 Text Arena 中夺得第 1 名。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2ca31299039a6c9",
      "translationZh": "开源模型：MiMo-V2.6-Pro 和 Flash 在开源模型中分别以第 5 名和第 9 名进入 Agent Arena。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "130691d65e6331c1",
      "translationZh": "其他独立评估：WeirdML v3 发现 Sol 的 Token 利用率非常高，接近 Astra 但峰值较低。在同一基准测试中，Sonnet 5.5 击败了 Opus 5，Grok 4.7 击败了 Kimi-K3；这些结果尚不完整 (@htihle)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1aa45cc06f4a1ce8",
      "translationZh": "推理风格：Design Arena 阅读了 324 份思维摘要。它发现 Astra 的对冲频率大约是 Opus 5.5 的 20 倍，而 Opus 在大约 5 份摘要中有 4 份会过早做出结论 (@DesignArena)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f0fbc6a005ce200",
      "translationZh": "Step 5 预览：StepFun 的模型在 Vals 上的评分为每项任务 2.54，在开源权重模型中排名第 7。它平均每项任务耗时近两小时，并拥有 1M Token 的上下文窗口 (Vals，详情)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "feab53a32cc0e96d",
      "translationZh": "Fable 5.5：传闻 Claude Fable 5.5 将于下周发布，并据称表现优于据报道因安全问题而推迟的“Astra 6.1”。发布者表示他无法证实这两项说法 (@kimmonismus，后续)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d304df1c56b16db",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Astra Lite：发现了一个“GPT-6 Astra Lite”的列表，@scaling01 推测这与 Sol 是同一个模型 (@scaling01)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a28066fc79581fd",
      "translationZh": "决策模型与开源权重：llama.cpp 添加了一个 /v1/systemone 端点，用于本地“Jev 风格”的决策模型推理 (@ggerganov)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bd02df9bf827b62",
      "translationZh": "本地运行：模型通过 llama serve -hf ggml-org/Kev-4B-GGUF 启动 (@ClementDelangue)。Jared Palmer 发布了一篇关于 Kev 1.0 如何工作的文章 (文章)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b774ae56db356e42",
      "translationZh": "生态系统：Perplexity 声称 pplx-decider-v1-27b 在 11 个基准测试中的平均得分为 85.7%，领先于 Jev (@AravSrinivas)。Clef 决策模型现在已上线 Ollama (@lucataco)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "634571d5e7c08b43",
      "translationZh": "持怀疑态度：@mervenoyann 称决策模型是零样本分类器的重新包装（推文）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5f66a67082a0498",
      "translationZh": "校准分析：一篇博客文章将 Jev-style 校准与价值及 Q 函数预测联系起来 ( @SOURADIPCHAKR18 ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5dea5cda333ee6d",
      "translationZh": "webAI TwIL-LM3-Pro：这个 3.66B 模型是在 Granite 4.2 上后训练的。在 webAI 的测试中，它在形式逻辑方面大约匹配 Qwen3-8B。Q4 GGUF 大小为 2.09 GiB，许可证为非商业用途 ( @kimmonismus ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1f2a9059728e474",
      "translationZh": "Reka RIDM：Reka 在 Apache 2.0 许可下发布了一个逆动力学模型。该模型在游戏数据上训练，能够泛化到真实视频并提取运动和摄像机动作 ( @RekaAILabs ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "707db374cd12eca3",
      "translationZh": "Agent Harnesses、Assistants 和 Developer Tooling",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7063ad50f4025009",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI dots：Sam Altman 称 dot 是他最喜欢的 OpenAI 产品，表示它随着学习他的工作流程而每日改进 ( @sama ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd69964ce28d5ba6",
      "translationZh": "能力：Dot 在各应用间保持上下文，协调 Codex 任务并标记需要关注的项目 ( @OpenAIDevs ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed7374337645db9d",
      "translationZh": "比较：一位用户更喜欢 Grokbot 的多智能体 “chief of staff” 设置 ( @kimmonismus )。 DIY 克隆使用 Pi、一个 Telegram 网关和任何模型 ( @_alejandroao ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9875779e7a1664fb",
      "translationZh": "Muse Gadgets：Meta 开源了 ESP32 固件和一个 Linux SDK，用于构建可与 Muse 配合工作的硬件（@natfriedman）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b11f420a6526be36",
      "translationZh": "Muse Home Link：Meta 生产了 5,000 台自家智能家居桥梁，供订阅者免费使用，直至送完（@alexandr_wang，发货）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4a083fa39880279",
      "translationZh": "可扩展的 harnesses：DeepSeek Harness 已发布 macOS 和 Windows 的桌面构建；Linux 用户可从 npm 安装 @deepseek-ai/dsh（@deepseek_ai）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4c9f044b3dca445",
      "translationZh": "Claude Code 插件：Mods 是带有类似中间件钩子的插件，集成到 Claude Code 中（@lydiahallie）。新的 “You should know” 插件会衍生出一个侧边代理，用于标记用户可能错过的重要输出（@ClaudeDevs）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9af21b239267964",
      "translationZh": "Pi Durable：Pi 现在通过 agents SDK v0.26.0 在 Cloudflare Durable Objects 上运行，与此同时发布了 Pi v1.0（@mattzcarey，@badlogicgames）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78d2fbd139a48177",
      "translationZh": "背景：@omarsar0 将这些发布视为向可塑 harnesses 转变的信号（线程）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54370c092c55961c",
      "translationZh": "T3 Code 编排器重写：该项目用户数已突破 400K（@theo）。其为期 4 个月的 PR，包含 1,912 个文件中的 823 次提交，现已合并（@maria_rcks）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd2523b77e237e0d",
      "translationZh": "新功能：重写加入了 Pi 支持、跨提供者 delegate_task、ACP 注册表、线程分叉、中途线程模型切换、子代理血统视图和定时任务（功能列表）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c5e0d79bff47a9f",
      "translationZh": "平台更新：OpenAI 的 Agents API 新增一键浏览器计算机使用、Bedrock Managed Agents 和可移植环境。它还声称 99.97% 的转动可靠性以及工具调用速度提升 20%（ @stevendcoffey ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acb61d0decbff14d",
      "translationZh": "Cursor Rollouts：当 Rollouts 检测到回归时，它会找到有问题的 PR，打开一个议题并提供一键云代理修复（ @cursor_ai ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b20bf25fbb8773b",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare：Sandbox SDK 1.0 为 Durable Objects 提供对沙盒容器的直接控制（ @CFchangelog ）。Cloudflare 还推出了请求 Traces（ @WalshyDev ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23c63c15551bab1c",
      "translationZh": "研究：Agent 训练、长时控制以及用于数学的 AI",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb7a02f0d415a13f",
      "translationZh": "多 harness 强化学习（Hugging Face）：相同的模型权重在一个 harness 中得分 62%，在另一个 harness 中得分 33%（ @huggingface ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dba0d1e870ae009d",
      "translationZh": "方法：一个代理能够使用 OpenAI、Anthropic 和 Gemini API 格式，并记录用于训练的采样 token IDs 和 logprobs，而无需更改 harness 本身。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0be7d4298d35e5c1",
      "translationZh": "结果：LFM2.5-2.6B 在四个 harness 中的表现从 42% 提升至 54%，并且工具调用次数减少了 31%。在 3,189 条 Qwen3.8-27B rollout 上进行 SFT 后，性能在 47.5% 处平台化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7d3af72b4e3eeaf",
      "translationZh": "发布：训练器、数据以及所有七个训练好的模型均已开源。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d727d6f8bc01763b",
      "translationZh": "信用分配和强化学习效率：ProVer 让判定器定位决定性轨迹片段，然后在两侧使用 rollouts 来设置该片段的 advantage。它报告相对于 GRPO 的相对提升为 +9.91%（Qwen3.5-2B）和 +7.12%（Qwen3.5-4B）（ @omarsar0 ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9783a56ffc5164d4",
      "translationZh": "部分 rollouts：AC2 使用学习得到的 critic 来对 token chunks 进行评分，因此训练只需要部分 rollouts（ @wen_kaiyue ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b6a2fbd25da86d1",
      "translationZh": "前沿学习：该方法针对能力边缘的问题，因为模型总是或永远无法解决的问题会导致 GRPO 梯度为零（ @robinfaro13 ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5d7148122998cb4",
      "translationZh": "锐化税：论文量化了后训练后 pass@K 可扩展性的损失，并提出 PTGS，即每个提示的温度采样器（ @iScienceLuvr ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3dc4711ca3d3987",
      "translationZh": "SFT 与 RL：另一篇论文发现 SFT 泛化能力较差，这是因为其数据是 off-policy，而不是因为目标。将专家轨迹重写为基础模型的风格可以缩小差距（ @maximelabonne ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "003cdcafa7977942",
      "translationZh": "长时控制和上下文：Meta Superintelligence Labs 报告称，专用控制器使 GPT-5.5 在 ProgramBench 上的性能从 63.7% 提升至 71.5%，使用相同的工作人员和预算，而 Codex 为 58.0%（ @dair_ai ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cd01a0975d1e697",
      "translationZh": "上下文压缩：Microsoft 的免训练 FOCUS 将峰值上下文降低多达 48%，并使任务成功率提高多达 8.9 个百分点（ @dair_ai ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf5859b4594cb165",
      "translationZh": "长上下文退化：NVIDIA 的 Long-Transduction 研究表明，在七个开放模型中，从 4K 到 128K 上下文时准确率下降 62.8%（ @dair_ai ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96e7a1e2c53a2b7a",
      "translationZh": "多智能体协调：在 AgentWorld 中，不到三分之一的多智能体动作有助于完成任务，且协调任务的成功率仅为 12% （ @omarsar0 ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4410d23a92066e9b",
      "translationZh": "Apple LoopCD：该方法将递归循环减半，同时将 AIME 2024 pass@1 从 61.88% 提升至 73.33% （ @arankomatsuzaki ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "becf9decd94c5c7b",
      "translationZh": "AI 在开放数学问题上：Meta 通过普通的 meta.ai 聊天发布了六篇使用 Muse Spark 1.1 和 1.2 生成的开放问题论文，未使用自定义脚手架（ @AIatMeta ，列表）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "595afea535e74e42",
      "translationZh": "过程：每篇论文标注哪些段落主要由人类或 AI 起草，并且第二组数学家审阅了该工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55dfff0b7aa5ac5a",
      "translationZh": "Google Cogentic：此 Gemini 多智能体系统在五个开放理论问题上产生了新结果（ @omarsar0 ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbab129fd4dcbaf0",
      "translationZh": "Cogentic 设计：每份草稿必须通过两个对抗验证器，且智能体共享已验证引理的账本。大多数问题大约需要 100 次调用；最难的问题大约需要 1,000 次调用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22ebd6056bbf5bd4",
      "translationZh": "图像后训练：Arena 将 Bradley-Terry 奖励模型与忠实度、约束和反奖励黑客奖励结合（ @arena ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7569d06bb570ca2a",
      "translationZh": "结果：FLUX.2-dev 的 Elo 分数提升 69 分至 1202，而 Ideogram 4 的 Elo 分数提升 20 分至 1224。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baec6916d614bd3f",
      "translationZh": "基准测试，评估完整性和安全性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6327a534c090fcd8",
      "translationZh": "研究品味基准：ScholarCatalyst 要求代理找出研究项目背后的“催化论文”。它由 184 位首席作者在其 207 个自身项目上标注，并被描述为远未饱和（@yoonholeee）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc02be729ce95fa4",
      "translationZh": "EurekaBench：此基准测试代理是否能够在六个科学领域中发现真正的新洞见（@JiayiiGeng）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "504fc57bb7325395",
      "translationZh": "Vals Web Search Index：该索引保持模型和 harness 不变，仅更换搜索工具，并在金融和法律任务上对最终答案进行评分（@ValsAI）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61a67b107f49563a",
      "translationZh": "验证：代理在不使用搜索时得分为 2.9%（法律）和 7.4%（金融），而使用搜索时得分为 30–50%。Vals 还引用了一项研究，其中模型在不使用搜索的情况下回答了 BrowseComp 的 44.5%（详情）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77bfe4bf4feed341",
      "translationZh": "SWE 错误查找基准：在该新基准中，代理从较旧的提交开始，并根据后续提交中修复的真实错误进行评分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b864b0cd852ed26",
      "translationZh": "批评：Lucas Beyer 认为它主要测试回忆，且其构建易于训练（@giffmana）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c3bfe2e83041900",
      "translationZh": "作者回应：作者表示，只要排除测试集，进行错误查找的训练是可以接受的（@OfirPress）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f616cc3f4eea8932",
      "translationZh": "评价完整性问题：David Rein 询问 Harbor（Terminal Bench 的框架）是否允许代理在评估前修改其轨迹。他指出他可能误读了代码（ @idavidrein ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95685eb516a1ab75",
      "translationZh": "开放模型的进攻能力：The Batch 报道 GLM-5.3 在利用漏洞方面几乎与 Claude Mythos 持平，分别为 12% 对 14%（ @DeepLearningAI ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63a07c0bb976d763",
      "translationZh": "有争议的说法：一位评论员表示 GLM-5.3 Flash 在 ExploitBench 上超过了 Mythos Preview（ @teortaxesTex ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0d2300bd099d77d",
      "translationZh": "未经过审查的变体：一个未经过审查的 GLM-5.3 正在 Hugging Face 上流传（ @kimmonismus ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "527323ea8522e47a",
      "translationZh": "安全研究与防护措施：一篇新论文提出在训练过程中使用内部信号来提升对齐，同时不降低白盒监控的效果（ @lenalibon ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bb41dd2184e1be4",
      "translationZh": "NeurIPS 接收：《知道评估如何设计的模型得分更安全》论文被 NeurIPS 2026 接收（ @HaritzPuerto ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42dd850709c21550",
      "translationZh": "误报：Opus 5.5 在声谱音节标注过程中经常触发“理由提取”防护措施（ @ChaseBrowe32432 ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "440bf7db04c8a3a4",
      "translationZh": "涌现的世界知识：向模型询问“陆地还是水域？”针对 16,200 组经纬度坐标，绘制其回答可得到一个可识别的世界地图（ @karpathy ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8dabb35bb61cd437",
      "translationZh": "推理、硬件与系统",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a8a2046d37dc15a",
      "translationZh": "通过 DeepSeek 内核的 Ascend 950：对 DeepSeek 开源的 DeepGEMM、FlashMLA、TileKernels 和 DeepEP 的分析推断了芯片的布局（ @ZhihuFrontier ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "096d7c3df99ab3da",
      "translationZh": "估算规格：该芯片拥有 32 个 AI 核心，每个核心包含一个 Cube 核心和两个 Vector 核心。估算峰值约为 432/865/1,730 TFLOPS（BF16/FP8/FP4）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4352ea56c602bd91",
      "translationZh": "产能：尽管有说法称 950s 于八月上市，但供应可能受限（ @teortaxesTex ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4083e4186c5ea1b5",
      "translationZh": "Prime 推理：Prime Intellect 将 MLA 潜 latent 存储在 NVFP4 中，将行从 576 字节缩减至 352 字节，相比 FP8 可缓存约多 50% 的 token（ @PrimeIntellect ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ddc21f3872a69df",
      "translationZh": "栈：它在 vLLM 和 Dynamo 上服务 GLM-5.3，且稀疏 MLA 内核将移至 FlashInfer（ @vllm_project ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97a3cd7f996d1215",
      "translationZh": "低精度基准测试：Stas Bekman 在 B200 上测得 NVFP4 比 MXFP4 高约 9% 的效率，且精度更高（ @StasBekman ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13b584407e7a6137",
      "translationZh": "mamf-finder：该工具现在基准测试 FP8、MXFP8、MXFP4 和 NVFP4（更新）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da48baf7d816730d",
      "translationZh": "内存和速度：NVHBM 将内存控制器移至自定义基底芯片，声称相比 HBM4E 带宽提高最高 30%，功耗降低 15%（ @vikramskr ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "959c7cfd5081fd15",
      "translationZh": "有争议的经济学：Micron 称 NVHBM 将提升其利润率；@vikramskr 持异议（反驳）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36e077aedde6bdb1",
      "translationZh": "Volantis：该初创公司希望利用光学技术，在超过 10T 参数的模型上实现每用户最高 10K tokens/s（ @omarsar0 ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98a1055eb1be831c",
      "translationZh": "Cerebras：Altman 称 Cerebras 是速度方面的紧密合作伙伴（ @sama ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec294d56f3f82374",
      "translationZh": "容量经济学（Epoch）：Epoch 估计 AI 基础设施不久将能够支持数亿到数十亿个代理（ @EpochAIResearch ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2c25fc40fed78ad",
      "translationZh": "需求缺口：仅 20% 的利用率意味着年支出为 2.6–5.3 万亿，而到 2027 年底的实验室收入约为 1 万亿（详情）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5b700289888d06e",
      "translationZh": "平台：SemiAnalysis 将 Google 的 GPU 集群评为 Gold 级，并指出 ConnectX NCCL 插件现已自动激活（ @SemiAnalysis_ ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcc89d04cdabab01",
      "translationZh": "联邦学习：Google Research 推出了基于 TEE 的联邦学习，并具备可验证的差分隐私（ @GoogleResearch ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f79c977edd833339",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 和 梵蒂冈：纽约时报报道称 Chris Olah 提出退出教皇的 AI 百科全书发布，该文本拒绝机器意识（ @ChristopherHale ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff8291692613c804",
      "translationZh": "游说：奥拉的团队据称游说教皇的顾问，让他们认真对待模型意识。他最终出席了（ @kimmonismus ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a72a581f50706ae1",
      "translationZh": "背景：文章开头奥拉说：“我们不知道 AI 模型是否有意识”（ @buccocapital ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0dc76a08204da8a",
      "translationZh": "批评：Aidan Gomez 将该运动批评为道德傲慢（ @aidangomez ）。Lucas Beyer 注意到 transcript 用词从 “create” 改为 “train”（ @giffmana ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20d8f308966527dd",
      "translationZh": "反安全影响运动：一份报告描述一个计划至少花费 100M 的团队，由前白宫副幕僚长领导，将 AI 警告描述为协调一致的运动（ @NeelNanda5 ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af96f634574a11e1",
      "translationZh": "新组织：Nathan Lambert 和 Tom Zick 创立了 Trillium Labs，这是一个专注于开放后训练配方和基础设施的非营利组织（ @natolambert ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41ed933f544702b5",
      "translationZh": "资金：初始支持来自 Halcyon Futures 和 Schmidt Sciences。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
